# ── What to KEEP in data/ ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# data/training_combined_v10_true.jsonl     ← canonical training set (tracked)
# data/manual_eval_set_1000.jsonl           ← natural test set (tracked)
# data/manual_eval_set_balanced_2000.jsonl  ← balanced benchmark (tracked)
# data/manual_eval_set_200.jsonl            ← original test set (tracked)
# data/manual_seed_1800.csv                 ← seed labels (tracked)

